    'Ships, characters and dioramas from across the saga.' => 'Naves, personajes y dioramas de toda la saga.',
    'Harry Potter' => 'Harry Potter',
    'Hogwarts, Diagon Alley, Quidditch and the recent book-nook models.' => 'Hogwarts, el Callejón Diagon, el Quidditch y los recientes modelos book nook.',
    'Marvel Super Heroes' => 'Marvel Super Heroes',
    'Avengers, Spider-Man, X-Men and the rest of the Marvel roster.' => 'Los Vengadores, Spider-Man, los X-Men y el resto de héroes de Marvel.',
